stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> INITIALIZED: Client submits query

    INITIALIZED --> PLANNING: Coordinator constructs ExecutionPlan
    PLANNING --> RESEARCHING: Research Agent assigned TASK-RES-002

    RESEARCHING --> ANALYZING: Evidence stored in SharedState
    RESEARCHING --> FAILED: Missing corpus or unhandled exception

    ANALYZING --> CRITIQUING: Insights & correlations stored in SharedState
    ANALYZING --> FAILED: Analytical model failure

    CRITIQUING --> REVISING: Critic issues REVISION_REQUIRED (cycle < max_revisions)
    REVISING --> RESEARCHING: Missing sources defect
    REVISING --> ANALYZING: Reasoning / correlation defect

    CRITIQUING --> WRITING: Critic issues APPROVED
    CRITIQUING --> WRITING: Circuit breaker triggered (cycle >= max_revisions)

    WRITING --> COMPLETED: Writer submits WriterReport & Traceability Matrix
    WRITING --> FAILED: Report synthesis failure

    COMPLETED --> [*]: Return WorkflowResponse
    FAILED --> [*]: Return Error Details
